      "updated": 1779170000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Blocked/discard/tombstone direction: local Owner.sqlite should own durable owner intent and private R2 lifecycle; public catalog should reflect exclusions by omission or sanitized derived rows only.",
